From b2955028e40b4fc8fd855e1de20121f682938dbe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: suvojeet-sengupta <suvojitsengupta21@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 17:26:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Settings: Add smart charging and force fast charging switches

Add two switches to the battery settings for charging modes the device
sets from persist.sys.smart_charging and persist.sys.force_fast_charge.
Smart charging stops at 80% to slow battery wear, force fast charging
drops the thermal current limits. They pull against each other, so
turning one on turns the other off. A switch only shows when the device
sets a default for its property.

Change-Id: I2feb72a4604d8a1c42a4aa15e6d9731b463f0736
---
 res/values/custom_strings.xml                 |  6 ++
 res/xml/power_usage_summary.xml               | 13 ++++
 .../ChargingModePreferenceController.java     | 76 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../ForceFastChargePreferenceController.java  | 15 ++++
 .../SmartChargingPreferenceController.java    | 15 ++++
 5 files changed, 125 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/com/android/settings/fuelgauge/ChargingModePreferenceController.java
 create mode 100644 src/com/android/settings/fuelgauge/ForceFastChargePreferenceController.java
 create mode 100644 src/com/android/settings/fuelgauge/SmartChargingPreferenceController.java

